<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Universal Skills for Engineers</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 p-8">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center bg-blue-600 text-white py-4">
      Universal Skills for Engineers
    </h2>
    <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200">
      <thead class="bg-gray-50">
        <tr>
          <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
            Skill
          </th>
          <th scope="col" class="px-6 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
            Why It Matters
          </th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200">
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Problem-Solving
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Core of engineering; helps you tackle complex challenges.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Data Structures & Algorithms
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Foundation for writing efficient code.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Programming Fundamentals
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Enables you to write clean, maintainable code.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Computer Science Concepts
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Deepens your understanding of how systems work.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Version Control (Git)
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Essential for collaboration and code management.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Debugging & Testing
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Ensures your code is reliable and bug-free.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Soft Skills
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Critical for teamwork and communication.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Mathematics & Logic
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Provides the tools to solve technical problems.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Lifelong Learning
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Keeps you adaptable in a fast-changing industry.
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900">
            Practical Experience
          </td>
          <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-500">
            Bridges the gap between theory and real-world application.
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
